<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p>When buying on Lively, accepted payment methods include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Payment cards like credit and debit cards</li>
            <li>Bank transfer</li>
            <li>PayPal</li>
            <li>Stripe</li>
            <li>Affirm and Klarna (Buy Now, Pay Later)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The payment methods available to you may depend on your device and location.</p>

        <h2>Add or edit your payment method</h2>
        <p>When you add or change a payment method, it becomes your default for future purchases and sets the current item or show. You can update your payment method anytime.</p>
        
        <p><strong>From your account</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app.</li>
            <li>Tap Account at the bottom of the screen.</li>
            <li>Select Payments & Shipping.</li>
            <li>Tap the pencil icon next to Add Payment Method.</li>
            <li>Choose a payment type.</li>
            <li>Add a new method or choose one you've already saved.</li>
        </ol>

        <p><strong>From a show</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Tap the Wallet icon in the bottom right.</li>
            <li>Tap Payment.</li>
            <li>Choose a payment type.</li>
            <li>Add a new method or choose one you've already saved.</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Remove a payment method</h2>
        <p>You'll only be able to delete a payment method if you've added more than one.</p>

